---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Games | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Lightweight prototype games index generated from the existing Cheeky Commodore Gamer database.
permalink: /games/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>Games</h1>
  <p class="lede">This page is generated at build time from the existing CCG games database. The complete normalized archive is now enabled in the isolated Eleventy prototype.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="prototype-games-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="prototype-games-heading">Generated game pages</h2>
    <p>{{ games | length }} records generated from <code>games/games.json</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="game-grid">
    {% for game in games %}
      {% include "components/game-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
